hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to  another edition of ask Evan in today's  episode I'm going to answer questions  from one of my readers Bridget who wrote  in saying she's not sure if she has what  it takes to be an entrepreneur and one  of my bison what to do so Bridget I  think a lot of people go through this  before they start their own business I  think the best thing you can do is start  by tapping into your passion so the  number one thing for entrepreneur  setting new business is follow something  you're passionate about do something  that gets you excited something that you  think you can add a lot of value and  help people out that's kind of number  one so the next thing is you don't  necessarily have to start your own  business own from the very beginning I  would go go work for somebody else who's  already doing what you're trying to do  so whatever your passion is look at you  know again that what excites you where  you like helping people and find  somebody who's already doing that and  offer to work for them and what I try to  do is get involved in that business as  much as possible so you're working to  learn you're still working for somebody  else but you're working with the goal of  eventually being able to become an  entrepreneur so you want to learn as  much as possible about how that business  runs try to you know take an extra hours  help the entrepreneur as much as  possible you ask any business owner  there's always too much work that  they're doing so you know when star  employees come up and say hey can I help  with something they love it right most  employees don't take that extra  initiative so you could be that person  you'll get a whole bunch of new  responsibilities often things that you  weren't hired to do but it will really  help your education because you're doing  this not necessarily for the money but  you're doing it for the education you're  doing it to learn how to run a business  in that industry you may discover that  this isn't what you thought it was that  you're not really excited about this  it's not your passion you don't really  want to open up a company in that space  and it was a great learning experience  and you did it without having to invest  a lot of money in fact you were paid to  learn about it so you know that's not  the situation go out and find another  job again in a similar industry that you  think you're really passionate  you want to learn more about that be the  easy way to kind of get started and then  the last thing I recommend is modeling  success so try to find people who've  accomplished a lot in your area of  choice and look at how they got started  and I see that usually they help for me  when I had my first real company I was  19 years old about tech software company  it was young guy didn't know what I was  doing had to go out and start selling  this software totally afraid so I just  started researching other famous  entrepreneurs with sold software I  thought you know I'm not the first guy  to go on try to sell software so our  research companies like Microsoft and  mcafee and into it and looked at how did  they get started now how do i think you  know make an extra million now but how  do they go from nothing to getting that  company off the ground and I looked at  their strategies for success and pulled  that into my business as well and that  was able to help us grow and that kind  of gave me the confidence to know that  hey these guys started from nothing just  an idea and look what they're able to  turn it into if I could do even a  quarter of that or a tenth of that I'm  still make a success so looking at those  stories and seeing how they came from  nothing just like where I was gave me  extra motivation and actually belief in  myself that I could do it so for that  helps so make sure you follow your  passion work to learn go to find you  know a job in your industry they help  you learn about the industry and then  model success to give you confidence and  ideas to be able to launch your own  business hopefully that helps if you  guys liked the video please give it a  thumbs up below and if you have a  question or we have something to add to  this video as well I love to hear from  you if you want to leave a comment under  the video and we'll see you on the next  episode  you  you
 

